  "details": "Ever since an update back in April the phys bones for my grabbable glasses have been broken. They jitter around when I move.\n\nNow I have figured out this is somehow tight to the games FPS.\n\nWhen the game runs on 30fps they don't jitter but everything above 30 they start moving.\n\nI put my glasses on the Tutorial avatar and made it public to test.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_e0aebe05-f4e1-4c53-bf29-fd6dc71253c5\n\nI also recorded a video showing it in game.",
